# Tabs on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Section: `demo-audit/TabsDemo.vue`, wired on DemoPage **directly below Cookies**.
- One sample per distinct look / component:
  - `DashboardTabs` — Orders received (default + mobile dropdown)
  - `DashboardTabs` — XRepost (`tabs-only`, counts, white active)
  - `DashboardTabs` — Analytics Top Media (`compact` + `tabs-only`, black active)
  - `MediaUploadTypeTabs` — UploadMediaPopup media types (icons)
  - `MediaUploadTypeTabs` — Preview Settings video substeps
  - `MediaUploadTypeTabs` — Publish & Sharing when-to-publish
  - `MyMediaTabs` — Media library status counts
  - `HomeServiceTabNav` — Home services pills
- Show Code uses the real component + feature `t()` keys — never `demo.` in snippets.
- Tab icons via asset map (`useAssetUrl`).
- Demo-only width/overflow wrappers (`demoDashboardTabsFitClass`, `demoHomeServiceTabsClass`) — never change `DashboardTabs` / `HomeServiceTabNav` defaults for production.

## Do not demo
- Near-identical DashboardTabs chrome (e.g. Premium Orders same as Orders received).
- Trailer-source MediaUploadTypeTabs when Publish 2-tab already covers that chrome.
- File-name captions above samples.
- Dark section stage backgrounds.
- Duplicate standalone tab samples inside HomePageDemo — HomeServiceTabNav belongs only here.
